sequenceDiagram
    participant Caller
    participant Service as TaskService
    participant Repository as TaskRepository
    participant Channel as NotificationChannel

    Caller->>Service: assign_task(task_id, assignee)
    Service->>Service: select channel by assignee.preferred_channel
    Service->>Repository: get(task_id)
    Repository-->>Service: task
    Service->>Service: assigned = replace(task, assignee_id)
    Service->>Repository: save(assigned)
    Note right of Repository: save returning models a completed commit

    alt Success (R1-R2)
        Repository-->>Service: committed
        Service->>Channel: send(contact, "You were assigned: {title}")
        Channel-->>Service: accepted
        Service-->>Caller: assigned task
    else SaveError (R3)
        Repository-->>Service: raise SaveError (no persisted change)
        Note over Service,Channel: zero send attempts
        Service-->>Caller: propagate SaveError
    else NotificationError (R4)
        Repository-->>Service: committed
        Service->>Channel: send(contact, "You were assigned: {title}")
        Channel-->>Service: raise NotificationError
        Service->>Service: log warning (task id only, no contact, no retry)
        Service-->>Caller: assigned task (normal return)
    end
